children":[["$","path","1cmpym",{"d":"M8 2v4"}],["$","path","4m81vk",{"d":"M16 2v4"}],["$","rect","1hopcy",{"width":"18","height":"18","x":"3","y":"4","rx":"2"}],["$","path","8toen8",{"d":"M3 10h18"}],"$undefined"]}],"3 August 2026",["$","span",null,{"className":"text-white/25","children":"·"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"BMB Renovation"}]]}]]}]}],["$","article",null,{"className":"py-14 sm:py-20 flex-grow bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-[800px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm border border-gray-100 p-6 sm:p-10","children":[["$","div",null,{"children":[["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Searching for kitchen renovation before and after cost examples can be more useful than looking at a single headline figure. As a rough guide, a simple refresh with the existing cabinets may cost several thousand pounds, while changing the layout, moving services or specifying bespoke cabinetry can take the same room into five-figure territory. This guide sets out illustrative UK examples so you can see what the money may pay for. Prices are rough guides rather than quotations: every project differs, and room size, access, condition, location and product choices all make a difference. Request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"What affects the cost of a kitchen transformation?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["The biggest distinction is whether the renovation keeps the existing layout. Retaining the sink, cooker and major appliances can limit plumbing and electrical work, whereas moving them may involve new pipework, wiring, wall repairs and additional labour. Cabinet quality also matters: flat-pack units, rigid pre-assembled cabinets and bespoke furniture can have very different prices. Worktops range from laminate to timber, quartz and natural stone, with fabrication and fitting added to the material cost. Finally, the condition of the floor, walls and ceiling may only become clear once the old kitchen is removed."]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Example 1: cosmetic kitchen refresh with the same layout"}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Thinking about your own project?"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation covers Watford, Bushey, Rickmansworth, St Albans, Hemel Hempstead and beyond — all trades in-house. Call +44 7775 758 717 or send us a message."]}],["$","$L4",null,{"href":"/contact","className":"inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-6 py-3 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] text-white text-sm font-bold hover:bg-[#b39668] transition-colors","children":["Get a Free Quote",["$","svg",null,{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":24,"height":24,"viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":2,"strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-arrow-right w-4 h-4","children":[["$","path","1ays0h",{"d":"M5 12h14"}],["$","path","xquz4c",{"d":"m12 5 7 7-7 7"}],"$undefined"]}]]}]]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Before: a tired but serviceable kitchen in a typical terraced or semi-detached home, with sound cabinet carcasses, dated doors, worn flooring and basic lighting. After: new doors and handles, a replacement worktop, fresh decoration, updated flooring and improved lighting, while the sink and appliances remain in their original positions. This approach can produce a visible transformation without the cost of a complete strip-out and redesign."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Replacement cabinet doors, end panels and handles: typically £1,500–£3,000"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Laminate worktop, sink and tap: roughly £700–£1,400"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Painting and minor wall preparation: around £500–£900"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Flooring and installation: approximately £600–£1,200"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Lighting, electrical alterations and small plumbing adjustments: about £400–£900"]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Removal, fitting and finishing labour: roughly £1,500–£2,500"]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Illustrative total: approximately £5,200–£9,900. Every project differs; request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Example 2: a complete mid-range replacement"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Before: an older kitchen with swollen units, uneven worktops and appliances that are no longer suitable for the household. After: the room is stripped back, the same basic layout is retained and new cabinets, appliances, worktops, splashbacks and flooring are installed. Keeping the services in place can reduce disruption, but the project still includes substantial removal, preparation and installation work. A mid-range specification might use factory-made cabinets, laminate or compact laminate worktops, standard integrated appliances and ceramic or porcelain tiling."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Removal and disposal of the old kitchen: approximately £600–£1,200"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["New cabinets, panels and standard internal fittings: roughly £3,500–£6,500"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Appliances, depending on brand and specification: around £2,000–£4,500"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktops, sink and tap: approximately £1,000–£2,200"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Electrical, plumbing and appliance connections: about £900–£1,800"]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Tiling, flooring and decoration: roughly £1,500–£3,000"]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Cabinet installation and associated labour: around £2,500–£4,500"]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Illustrative total: approximately £12,000–£23,700. Every project differs; request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Example 3: changing the layout and adding an island"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Before: a narrow galley kitchen with limited worktop space, poor circulation and a sink positioned away from the main preparation area. After: the layout is opened up where possible, units are repositioned and a compact island or peninsula creates more storage and workspace. This is where before-and-after photographs can look most dramatic, but the cost is not just the extra cabinets. Moving water, waste, sockets, lighting and extraction may require more preparation, making the labour element higher than in a like-for-like replacement."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Design, surveys and setting out: roughly £500–£1,200"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Strip-out, alterations and waste removal: approximately £1,000–£2,000"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["New cabinets, island units and storage accessories: around £5,000–£9,000"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Worktops, including island fabrication and cut-outs: roughly £2,000–£4,500"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Moving plumbing, waste, electrics and lighting: approximately £2,000–£4,500"]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Appliances and extraction: around £2,500–£6,000"]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Flooring, splashbacks, decoration and making good: about £2,000–£4,000"]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Installation and finishing labour: roughly £3,500–£6,500"]}]]}],["$","li","8",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Illustrative total: approximately £18,500–£37,700. Every project differs; request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"Example 4: higher-specification kitchen with structural work"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Before: a small, enclosed kitchen that makes poor use of the available space. After: a larger connected kitchen-diner created by removing a non-load-bearing partition or making a carefully designed opening, with bespoke or premium cabinetry, durable worktops and upgraded appliances. If a wall is load-bearing, structural advice and approvals or inspections may be required depending on the work and location. Those costs are highly project-specific and should be confirmed before work starts. A project of this type may also overlap with wider house renovation work rather than being a standalone kitchen fitting job."]}],["$","ul",null,{"className":"my-5 space-y-2.5","children":[["$","li","0",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Surveys, design and structural advice where required: roughly £1,000–£3,000"]}]]}],["$","li","1",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Strip-out, wall alterations and waste removal: approximately £2,000–£5,000"]}]]}],["$","li","2",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Premium or bespoke cabinetry: around £8,000–£18,000 or more"]}]]}],["$","li","3",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Quartz, porcelain or natural-stone worktops: approximately £3,000–£7,000"]}]]}],["$","li","4",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Higher-specification appliances and extraction: roughly £5,000–£12,000"]}]]}],["$","li","5",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Plumbing, electrical work, lighting and heating alterations: about £3,000–£7,000"]}]]}],["$","li","6",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Flooring, tiling, decoration and final making good: around £3,000–£6,000"]}]]}],["$","li","7",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Installation and project labour: approximately £5,000–£10,000"]}]]}],["$","li","8",{"className":"flex gap-3 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":[["$","span",null,{"className":"mt-2.5 h-1.5 w-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#C8A97E] flex-shrink-0"}],["$","span",null,{"children":["Illustrative total: approximately £30,000–£68,000, depending heavily on structural and product choices. Every project differs; request a free, no-obligation quote for accurate pricing."]}]]}]]}],["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-2xl sm:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-12 mb-4","children":"How to compare before-and-after quotes properly"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Ask each contractor to separate products, labour and any third-party costs rather than providing one unexplained total. Check whether the quote includes removal, waste disposal, delivery, flooring, splashbacks, appliance connection, decorating, handles, panels and final sealant. Confirm whether VAT is included and whether the stated appliances are specific models or allowances. It is also sensible to keep a contingency for hidden defects and requested changes; some homeowners use around 10% as a planning allowance, although the appropriate amount depends on the property and the certainty of the design."]}],["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 tracking-tight mt-8 mb-3","children":"A practical way to control the budget"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Decide early which changes matter most. If storage and appearance are the priority, retaining the layout may deliver better value. If the room is fundamentally awkward, spending more on plumbing and electrical alterations can improve everyday use for years. You can also balance the specification: invest in a hard-wearing worktop and well-planned storage, while choosing standard appliance sizes or a simpler splashback. For homeowners in Watford and nearby areas, BMB Renovation provides ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/kitchen-fitting-watford","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"kitchen fitting in Watford"}],", with plumbing, tiling, electrical and cabinet installation handled in-house. You can also review ",["$","$L4","1",{"href":"/portfolio","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"recent projects"}]," to help clarify the finish you want."]}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed my-5","children":["Every kitchen needs a site-specific assessment before a reliable price can be given. Existing wiring, flooring levels, ventilation, access and the condition of walls can all change the scope. BMB Renovation is based at 157 Judge Street, Watford WD24 5AN, and offers free, no-obligation quotes for homeowners across Hertfordshire, North London and Bedfordshire. A clear brief, measured room and preferred specification will make the estimate more useful; ",["$","$L4","0",{"href":"/contact","className":"text-[#C8A97E] font-medium underline decoration-[#C8A97E]/40 underline-offset-2 hover:decoration-[#C8A97E] transition-colors","children":"request a free quote"}]," once you are ready to discuss the project."]}],["$","aside",null,{"className":"my-10 rounded-2xl bg-gradient-to-br from-gray-900 via-gray-800 to-gray-900 p-6 sm:p-8 border border-[#C8A97E]/30","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl sm:text-2xl font-bold text-white tracking-tight mb-2","children":"Get a Free, No-Obligation Quote"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-white/70 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed mb-5","children":["BMB Renovation handles kitchens, bathrooms and full home renovations across Watford, Hertfordshire, North London & Bedfordshire — all trades in-house. Tell us about your project today."]}],["$","$L4